From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWWorm <noreply@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:28:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add DLSS scaling mode, frame generation and ray
 reconstruction inputs

Viewport.SCALING_3D_MODE_DLSS falls back to FSR2 when DLSS is not
available. Ray reconstruction guides are set per frame on the scene
buffers.
